From 2e8be791db2a9fe02e8da7055e5989d53f97dce6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:22:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(contour): a None lead-in stands the wall arc entry down

With both leads None, the outside contour's Arc entry descended a
vertical arc that ran back along the seam's tangent. From above it
read as a straight lead into the seam. A None lead-in now takes the
grazing dive at the ring's start and names the stand-down.

Fixes #3132

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
